..
..
.. include standard programs
.input "ARB"
..
.. variable definitions
..
.type bool  xbDruckVKRE
.type bool  xbRMeldAn
.type text  xProtDrucker
.type text  xdDFUEEXPEDI2IHS
.type text  xdDfueExpEdi2INV
